msgid "Read posts in a Series"
msgstr "Baca pos dalam Seri"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:23
msgid ""
"List readable posts with their native part numbers, pending order, status "
"and date. Pagination filters unreadable objects first. Get-post-series "
"supplies edit tokens for individual posts."
msgstr ""
"Daftar pos yang dapat dibaca dengan nomor bagian bawaan mereka, urutan yang "
"tertunda, status, dan tanggal. Penyaringan paginasi mengutamakan objek yang "
"tidak dapat dibaca. Get-post-series menyediakan token edit untuk pos "
"individu."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:24
msgid "Inspect a Series or category"
msgstr "Periksa Seri atau kategori"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:24
msgid ""
"Read name, description, icon, order, category assignments and "
"expected_hash. Series Categories use taxonomy=category. Parent IDs apply to "
"hierarchical categories."
msgstr ""
"Baca nama, deskripsi, ikon, urutan, penugasan kategori, dan expected_hash. "
"Kategori Seri menggunakan taxonomy=category. ID induk berlaku untuk "
"kategori hierarkis."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:25
msgid "Create or update a Series or category"
msgstr "Buat atau perbarui Seri atau kategori"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:25
msgid ""
"Create with name, or patch an existing id and expected_hash. Omitted fields "
"remain unchanged. icon_id is a readable image attachment; zero clears the "
"Series icon. category_ids replace Series category assignments; [] clears "
"them. dry_run previews."
msgstr ""
"Buat dengan nama, atau tambal id yang sudah ada dan expected_hash. Bidang "
"yang dihilangkan tetap tidak berubah. icon_id adalah lampiran gambar yang "
"dapat dibaca; nol menghapus ikon Seri. category_ids menggantikan penugasan "
"kategori Seri; [] menghapusnya. dry_run memberikan prabaca."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:26
msgid "Delete a Series or category"
msgstr "Hapus Seri atau kategori"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:26
msgid ""
"Delete a native taxonomy term without deleting its posts. Requires the "
"current term and membership token and permission to edit all affected "
"posts. dry_run previews. Large collections remain in native administration."
msgstr ""
"Hapus istilah taksonomi bawaan tanpa menghapus posnya. Memerlukan istilah "
"saat ini dan token keanggotaan serta izin untuk mengedit semua pos yang "
"terpengaruh. dry_run memberikan prabaca. Koleksi besar tetap ada dalam "
"administrasi bawaan."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:27
msgid "Inspect a post’s Series and block assignments"
msgstr "Periksa penugasan Seri dan blok pos"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:27
msgid ""
"Read Series membership, part numbers, widget short title and Series "
"Gutenberg block attributes for a readable editable supported post. Returns "
"expected_hash covering affected Series order and content."
msgstr ""
"Baca keanggotaan Seri, nomor bagian, judul pendek widget, dan atribut blok "
"Gutenberg Seri untuk pos yang dapat dibaca dan diedit yang didukung. "
"Mengembalikan expected_hash yang mencakup urutan dan konten Seri yang "
"terpengaruh."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:28
msgid "Set post Series, part numbers and widget title"
msgstr "Atur Seri pos, nomor bagian, dan judul widget"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:28
msgid ""
"Replace memberships with items; [] removes all. Omit items to update only "
"short_title. Part zero uses native automatic placement. Multiple Series "
"requires active Pro Multiple Series. All posts whose numbering can change "
"require native read/edit permission. Read expected_hash from get-series "
"before adding a new membership. dry_run previews."
msgstr ""
"Ganti keanggotaan dengan item; [] menghapus semuanya. Hilangkan item untuk "
"memperbarui hanya short_title. Bagian nol menggunakan penempatan otomatis "
"bawaan. Banyak Seri memerlukan Pro Multiple Series yang aktif. Semua pos "
"yang penomorannya dapat berubah memerlukan izin baca/edit bawaan. Bacalah "
"expected_hash dari get-series sebelum menambahkan keanggotaan baru. dry_run "
"memberikan prabaca."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:31
msgid "Update Series memberships for multiple posts"
msgstr "Perbarui keanggotaan Seri untuk beberapa pos"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:31
msgid ""
"Validate every explicit post, Series token and native permission before "
"updating up to 20 posts. Each row uses the same input as "
"update-post-series. Omitted fields are preserved. dry_run previews all "
"rows. Native numbering is not transactional; inspect complete, applied_ids "
"and failed_id before retrying a partial result."
msgstr ""
"Validasi setiap pos eksplisit, token Seri, dan izin asli sebelum "
"memperbarui hingga 20 pos. Setiap baris menggunakan input yang sama seperti "
"update-post-series. Bidang yang diabaikan dipertahankan. dry_run "
"menampilkan pratinjau semua baris. Penomoran asli tidak bersifat transaksi; "
"periksa complete, applied_ids, dan failed_id sebelum mencoba lagi hasil "
"sebagian."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:32
msgid "Order, publish, schedule or unpublish Series posts"
msgstr "Urutkan, terbitkan, jadwalkan, atau hapus publikasi pos Seri"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:32
msgid ""
"Native Series Order and Publish Series workflows. Get expected_hash from "
"get-series. order requires the complete counted post set and never "
"publishes drafts. pending-order requires complete unpublished set. publish "
"accepts selected pending/draft posts; date is optional site-local "
"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM for scheduling. unpublish affects the entire Series. trash "
"requires explicit post_ids and native deletion capabilities. mark-published "
"changes only the Series marker. date-asc/date-desc reuse native "
"publication-date ordering. Cross-Series status transitions require "
"series_tokens from get-series for the other memberships. sync-menu-order "
"copies part numbers to WordPress menu order. All affected objects are "
"preflighted; native multi-step operations are not transactional. dry_run "
"previews."
msgstr ""
"Urutan dan alur kerja terbitkan Seri asli. Dapatkan expected_hash dari "
"get-series. urutan memerlukan set pos lengkap yang dihitung dan tidak "
"pernah menerbitkan draf. pending-order memerlukan set yang belum "
"diterbitkan sepenuhnya. terbitkan menerima pos pending/draf yang dipilih; "
"tanggal bersifat opsional site-local YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM untuk penjadwalan. "
"hapus publikasi memengaruhi seluruh Seri. tempat sampah memerlukan post_ids "
"eksplisit dan kemampuan penghapusan asli. mark-published hanya mengubah "
"penanda Seri. date-asc/date-desc menggunakan urutan tanggal publikasi asli. "
"Transisi status lintas Seri memerlukan series_tokens dari get-series untuk "
"keanggotaan lainnya. sync-menu-order menyalin nomor bagian ke urutan menu "
"WordPress. Semua objek yang terpengaruh diperiksa terlebih dahulu; operasi "
"multi-langkah asli tidak bersifat transaksi. dry_run menampilkan pratinjau."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:33
msgid "Add or configure a Series Gutenberg block"
msgstr "Tambahkan atau konfigurasikan blok Gutenberg Seri"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:33
msgid ""
"Append a native Series block or update one using its zero-based path from "
"get-post-series. Only registered Series block attributes are accepted, with "
"native editor availability and layout access checks. No arbitrary HTML or "
"other block edits. dry_run previews."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan blok Seri asli atau perbarui satu menggunakan jalur berbasis nol "
"dari get-post-series. Hanya atribut blok Seri yang terdaftar yang diterima, "
"dengan ketersediaan editor asli dan pemeriksaan akses tata letak. Tidak ada "
"HTML sembarangan atau suntingan blok lainnya. dry_run menampilkan pratinjau."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:64
msgid "This Series term does not exist."
msgstr "Istilah Seri ini tidak ada."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:72
