#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:551
msgid ""
"A native bulk update could not be fully confirmed. Read affected objects "
"before retrying."
msgstr ""
"Pembaruan massal asli tidak dapat dikonfirmasi sepenuhnya. Baca objek yang "
"terpengaruh sebelum mencoba lagi."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:555
msgid ""
"Post content changed during the native batch. Read affected posts before "
"retrying."
msgstr ""
"Konten pos berubah selama batch asli. Baca pos yang terpengaruh sebelum "
"mencoba lagi."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:581
msgid "Every target must belong to this Series."
msgstr "Setiap target harus menjadi bagian dari Seri ini."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:588
msgid "This operation applies to the Series; omit post_ids."
msgstr "Operasi ini berlaku untuk Seri; abaikan post_ids."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:591
msgid "Publication dates apply only to publish operations."
msgstr "Tanggal publikasi hanya berlaku untuk operasi publikasi."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:594
msgid "Supply explicit post_ids for this operation."
msgstr "Sediakan post_ids eksplisit untuk operasi ini."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:600
msgid "Native menu-order targets could not be read."
msgstr "Target urutan menu asli tidak dapat dibaca."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:607
msgid "Menu-order sync accepts only native published, numbered posts."
msgstr ""
"Sinkronisasi urutan menu hanya menerima pos yang diterbitkan dan dinomori "
"secara asli."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:614
msgid "Supply the complete native ordered post set; no hidden targets are changed."
msgstr ""
"Sediakan set pos terurut asli yang lengkap; tidak ada target tersembunyi "
"yang diubah."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:676
msgid "Use a valid site-local publication date."
msgstr "Gunakan tanggal publikasi yang valid dan bersifat lokal."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:811
msgid "Read the current Series block path before editing."
msgstr "Baca jalur blok Seri saat ini sebelum mengedit."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:79
msgid "Read Series layout fields and settings"
msgstr "Baca bidang dan pengaturan tata letak Seri"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:79
msgid ""
"Inspect a Post List Box, Post Details or Post Navigation layout. Omit id to "
"discover native fields/defaults for a new layout. Includes exact JSON "
"schema, native labels and edition locks. Use list-layouts to find IDs."
msgstr ""
"Periksa Kotak Daftar Pos, Detail Pos, atau tata letak Navigasi Pos. Abaikan "
"id untuk mengetahui bidang/default asli untuk tata letak baru. Termasuk "
"skema JSON yang tepat, label asli, dan penguncian edisi. Gunakan "
"list-layouts untuk menemukan ID."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:80
msgid "Find Series layouts"
msgstr "Temukan tata letak Seri"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:80
msgid "List readable native Series layouts, including trash when requested."
msgstr ""
"Daftar tata letak Seri asli yang dapat dibaca, termasuk tempat sampah saat "
"diminta."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:88
msgid "Create or update a Series layout"
msgstr "Buat atau perbarui tata letak Seri"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:88
msgid ""
"Create a published layout or patch one by id and expected_hash. Use "
"get-layout for exact per-module field types and locks. JSON booleans for "
"checkboxes, integers for sizes and image IDs, strings for select choices. "
"Omitted fields and unrelated metadata remain unchanged. dry_run previews."
msgstr ""
"Buat tata letak yang diterbitkan atau perbaiki satu berdasarkan id dan "
"expected_hash. Gunakan get-layout untuk jenis bidang dan penguncian "
"per-modul yang tepat. Boolean JSON untuk kotak centang, integer untuk "
"ukuran dan ID gambar, string untuk pilihan select. Bidang yang diabaikan "
"dan metadata yang tidak terkait tetap tidak berubah. dry_run menampilkan "
"pratinjau."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:89
msgid "Trash, restore or delete a Series layout"
msgstr "Tempat sampah, pulihkan, atau hapus tata letak Seri"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:89
msgid ""
"Native layout lifecycle. Read id and expected_hash first. Permanent "
"deletion requires prior trash and native delete permission. dry_run "
"previews."
msgstr ""
"Siklus hidup tata letak asli. Baca id dan expected_hash terlebih dahulu. "
"Penghapusan permanen memerlukan tempat sampah sebelumnya dan izin "
"penghapusan asli. dry_run menampilkan pratinjau."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:124
msgid "Use native administration for more than 1,000 layouts."
msgstr "Gunakan administrasi asli untuk lebih dari 1.000 tata letak."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:148
msgid "Supply a title for the new layout."
msgstr "Sediakan judul untuk tata letak baru."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:154
msgid "Restore the layout before editing."
msgstr "Pulihkan tata letak sebelum mengedit."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:167
msgid "This layout field requires an active Pro feature."
msgstr "Kolom tata letak ini memerlukan fitur Pro yang aktif."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:205
msgid ""
"The layout exists but its settings were not fully confirmed. Read before "
"retrying."
msgstr ""
"Tata letak ada tetapi pengaturannya belum sepenuhnya dikonfirmasi. Baca "
"sebelum mencoba lagi."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:223
msgid "This lifecycle operation does not match the current layout state."
msgstr "Operasi siklus hidup ini tidak cocok dengan keadaan tata letak saat ini."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Registry.php:47
msgid "Use the exact fields, types and choices returned by discovery."
msgstr "Gunakan kolom, tipe, dan pilihan yang tepat yang dikembalikan oleh penemuan."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Registry.php:52
msgid "You do not have permission to use this Series operation."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk menggunakan operasi Seri ini."

