#, php-format
msgid "Invalid JSON type at %s."
msgstr "Tipe JSON tidak valid di %s."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Registry.php:168
msgid ""
"Series could not complete this operation. Inspect the current state before "
"retrying; some changes may have been saved."
msgstr ""
"Seri tidak dapat menyelesaikan operasi ini. Periksa keadaan saat ini "
"sebelum mencoba lagi; beberapa perubahan mungkin telah disimpan."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Registry.php:200
msgid "This object changed. Read it again before saving."
msgstr "Objek ini telah berubah. Baca lagi sebelum menyimpan."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Registry.php:205
msgid ""
"The operation could not be fully confirmed. Read the object before "
"retrying; some changes may have been saved."
msgstr ""
"Operasi tidak dapat sepenuhnya dikonfirmasi. Baca objek sebelum mencoba "
"lagi; beberapa perubahan mungkin telah disimpan."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Settings.php:79
msgid "Read Series settings and choices"
msgstr "Baca pengaturan dan pilihan Seri"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Settings.php:79
msgid ""
"Discover native Series Settings: automatic displays, layouts, legacy "
"templates, category archives, metabox, sorting, uninstall policy and active "
"Pro features. Booleans use JSON true/false; layout IDs are integers. No "
"license or account credentials are returned."
msgstr ""
"Temukan Pengaturan Seri asli: tampilan otomatis, tata letak, template "
"warisan, arsip kategori, metabox, pengurutan, kebijakan uninstall, dan "
"fitur Pro yang aktif. Boolean menggunakan JSON true/false; ID tata letak "
"adalah bilangan bulat. Tidak ada lisensi atau kredensial akun yang "
"dikembalikan."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Settings.php:80
msgid "Update Series settings"
msgstr "Perbarui pengaturan Seri"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Settings.php:80
msgid ""
"Patch the exact keys discovered by get-plugin-settings. Preserve omitted "
"settings. Read expected_hash first. dry_run previews without saving. Pro "
"addon and post-type changes take effect on the next request. Taxonomy "
"identity migrations remain in native administration."
msgstr ""
"Perbaiki kunci tepat yang ditemukan oleh get-plugin-settings. Pertahankan "
"pengaturan yang dihilangkan. Baca expected_hash terlebih dahulu. dry_run "
"menampilkan pratinjau tanpa menyimpan. Tambahan Pro dan perubahan jenis pos "
"berlaku pada permintaan berikutnya. Migrasi identitas taksonomi tetap dalam "
"administrasi asli."

